      "SIMULATION at 73 fps (locked to the 145 Hz screen). Set Config.simulate=False for the real camera.\n",
      "This computer can't keep up: switching to a steady 48 fps.\n",
      "Ran 2880 frames in 46 s (63 fps), 94% on time. Final rate 48 fps.\n"
